popper is academic research material: its loop produces tentative, corroborated-or-refuted conjectures about a pinned testbed, not advice, not a claim that any conjecture is true, and not a licence to reuse the cited sources beyond their own terms; the human Steward alone sets the problem and the rules of refutation, and an automated agent does not become the Steward, a judge of its own conjectures, or an author of the data by running it.
